### End-to-End Manual Testing Procedure (Admin ↔ Driver Flow)
1. **Admin Login & Assignment**: Admin Website creates shipment `JOS-TEST-001` and assigns to Driver `DRV-101`.
2. **Driver Login**: Driver App logs in with driver credentials (`tan.weiming@josanlogistics.com`).
3. **Trip Appearance**: Driver sees `JOS-TEST-001` on Dashboard / My Trips via Supabase query & Realtime.
4. **Status Progression**:
   - Driver presses "Accept Trip" -> Status becomes `ACCEPTED`. Admin Website sees `ACCEPTED`.
   - Driver presses "Go to Pickup" -> Status becomes `GOING_TO_PICKUP`.
   - Driver presses "Mark Arrived" -> Status becomes `ARRIVED_AT_PICKUP`.
   - Driver completes pickup -> Status becomes `PICKUP_COMPLETED`.
   - Driver starts transit -> Status becomes `IN_TRANSIT`.
   - Driver reaches destination -> Status becomes `ARRIVED_AT_DELIVERY`.
5. **Proof of Delivery & Completion**:
   - Driver submits signature, photo, and receiver name.
   - Files upload to Supabase Storage.
   - Status updates to `DELIVERY_COMPLETED`.
   - Admin Website sees `DELIVERY_COMPLETED` and opens POD certificate.
6. **Location Telematics**:
   - Driver location pings insert into `driver_locations`.
   - Admin Website map reflects driver's latest position.
